This patch modifies SWE-QA-Bench (https://github.com/peng-weihan/SWE-QA-Bench),
commit c13deac, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE-SWE-QA-Bench).
Changed by the Codebase Explorer authors in October 2026:
  Experiment/Script/SWE-agent_QA/qa_agent.py, local_env.py, agent_models.py, agent_tools.py;
  Benchmark construction/score/llm-as-a-judge.py.
Changes: arm prompt in _build_instance_prompt; observation limit 20,000 characters; step limit;
tool subprocess PATH and absolute cbe path; a sandboxed tool subprocess; bash allowed only for
clean cbe commands in arm C; OpenAI-compatible judge client.

